    "Wang Liping is the chairman of Shanghai-listed Jiangsu Hengli Hydraulic, which makes oil cylinders, hydraulic valves and hydraulic castings.",
    "Wang founded the company in 1990. Today it has seven research centers and 12 manufacturing sites in China, Germany, the U.S., Japan and Mexico.",
    "Hengli's clients include Caterpillar, Kobelco and China's Sany Heavy Industry.",
    "Hengli opened a 141,000-square-meter factory in Mexico in 2025 to serve customers across the Americas."
